'''Car''' is an [[Enemy Bases|enemy base]] that appears in the [[Street Fighter Collaboration Event]]. It was added in [[Version 8.10 Update#Update 8.10.5|Version 8.10.5]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Car
|image = E 487.png
|first appearance = [[BONUS STAGE (Easy)]]
|money drop = N/A
}}

==Enemy==
Just like any other base enemy, it doesn't attack but in the stage it appears in, it comes in high buffs to take more time to destroy so you don't get the [[Timed Score Reward]]s.

==Strategy==
The best way to counter it is using fast units like [[Express Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Maglev Cat]] or [[Cow Cat (Normal Cat)|Cow Cat]] and high DPS units like [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] or [[Sanada Yukimura (Uber Rare Cat)|Immortal Yukimura]].

